{
  "id": "ACT.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Tlehhma'Aá Ya/Abuuse 17",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo nee Sila tari waaraáhh ar tla/ángw Amfipoli nee Apolonia, tari hardáh ay Tesalonike. Didaádae do'ko saalíngw múk Yahudi i deer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo iri baraadí dáh adoodá' /iisí i tlehhahhiti. Deelo tám ar Sabaáto gari baraadá' wa hhe'eés, tiwa tlaampa'aamisiya' nee múk Yahudi daanduú Gooír axweesantá Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá Mungú gari dir'ín i gwa/atimís nee gari alki/iít adór Kristo gár kuwa hariím aqo kun slahh'eemiis, nee niri waslee/ baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale. Iri oó', «Yésuuwí kaangós án ni alki/iit, inós an Kristo.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahh'alé baraá tla/angw'ine tari ya/án, tari haragwaá' nee Paulo nee Sila. Nee múk Yunani sleeme oo yaariír baraá kudá' Munguú ilaiwawa/a'a, tari ya/án, tam /ameenár hhaawaaká ar uren sleeme iri ya/aán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yahudi da/i guri ót. Múk kuri tawo wa/angwsíng wa sleemiís, kuri burumbuúr as boo/aay kuwa slay. Tlaahhi kari qaás baraá gixsár wa ale. Tari haratláy dír doó Yasoni, as Paulo nee Sila kiwa leelehhiiti nee kiwa huwi dír geeraá boo/oó muu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kiwa slayká, Yasoni kuri óh, nee hhae bahh'alé, kiri huúw dír geeraá múk urén oo gixsa, tari tsimaahhuús, ta kaahi, «Mukdá' yaamu gaa halelee' naa ayaawí hardáh sleeme, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Yasoni mukwí gwa dahi'ís baraá do'ós i alé. Inooín sleémeero muruú ta tlehhahhiti a kudá' nee hara'ayár waawutmoó múk Roma ti slaslawa'aaká. Asma inooín ta kaahi waawutmoó hatlá' i deer, ku bay a Yesu!» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe boo/aydá' nee múk urén oo gixsa tari kwisliít axweesanaydá' kuwa axaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Yasoni nee mukós doohhisaro kiwa hhe'eés, kiri geemáy as tawa quutli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamtidár kilae hhae Paulo nee Sila ngiri bayé', «Tlawsé' xweeraaká' alé ay Berea.» Tawa hardáh tari dáh baraá doó saalíngw múk Yahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Berea a múk hhó' ta ak múk Tesalonikero, nee inooín Ya/abtór hho' ngina ilaaohiyé' ar muunuú hhoó'. Gooi ngiri soomuusiyé', nee ngiri aldakuutiyé' umuúqo daqto, as ngiwa tsaahhiya' áx kaangwí taa alki/iiti oo lóe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk yaariír baraá tla/angw'ine iri haratlintií', /ameenár uren ar yaariir ar múk Yunani sleeme iri haratlintí', tam hhawaataá hhaawa'aaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk Yahudi oo yaamaá Tesalonike kangw kuri axaás adór axweesantá Mungú Paulo ngira alki/iít baraá yaamaá Berearo sleeme. Tari tláy, tari amoodí hardáh, tlaahhi kari qaás, muu kuri amoqwaareés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamtidár kilae hhaeedá' Paulo nguri ádbayé' iwa gayuú hatlá' oo tláwtí waaraahhi. Ala Sila nee Timoteo niri Berearí meetiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukdá' Paulo gwa haydohiis, guri huúw ay Athene. Aluuwo Paulo giri ya/aáw iwa kaahi, «Sila nee Timoteo mindiwa ak tligiyé' aluueene.» Mukdá' iri kií/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo Sila nee Timoteo giri Athénér wa dán. Gixsadá' gari ár naxés aa háts slaqsa'aá munguaá hatlae, iri ló'wa gurhaamuút baraá muunaáwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár iwa baraá doó saalíngw i dirii'i nee múk Yahudi tiri tlaampa'aamisiyé' nee mukdá' Munguú ilaiwawaá/. Nee umuúqo deelooro tiri tlaampa'aamisiyé' nee mukdá' nee inós ti dogagita' didá' mura' kuwa weerimamisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukko intsaahhasár Epikuro nee ar Stoiki tiri tlaampa'aamisiyé' nee Paulo. Bahh'alé tari oó', «Daktantí gár i ooár wa sla' a milá?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahh'alé tari oó', «Baré a adór heé ya/abtór munguaá xuawaslen ga alki/iít.» Adoorí kana oó' asma inós kángw Yesu guna alki/iít, nee kángw waasle/uuwós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri óh, kuri huúw ay Areopago. Tari oó', «Xáy, intsaahhatisasíng /aben kuúng ta intsaahhatimis, atén xu'utiro a aleeslawaána? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma muruú kuúng ta axwes ku xuaawaslén baraá iiaarene. Atén muruusíng u sla'aán xu'utiro.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk Athene sleémeero nee dahaayér baraadá' wa hoota, pa/ángw gár hatlá' i kaahh, aqo har kángw /abén kuwa kaahi nee kuwa axamiisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo iri sihhiít tla/ángw doó kwasleema oo ta bay Areopago, iri oó', «Kuúngá' múk Athene, baraá mura' sleémeero aníng naa tsaáhh adór kuungá' tar múk diínír aldakuút kángw kilá' wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aníng ana hi'iimiít baraá gixsarí wa ale, nee qoomár niwa hi'iimiit, kitángw ilahhooa una ár oo taa gooín /aymi'iiká' i alé, ‹Dír munguúdá' xu'utiitaaká.› Ala aníng kángw ni alki/iit an kángw Munguúdá' kuungá' ta sluufmisa', kudá' kuungá' ta xua'aaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munguúdá' yaamu gaa tleehh, nee umuúqo gaaro ar baraawós i dirii', inós i hootiiká baraá maraá taa dabaá múk ar tleéhh. Inós a Aakoó doori nee yaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laqaá inós gár i slai i káhh, tidá' inós kura sagadiyuús ar dabaá muu. Asma inós an kudá' muu sleémeero gu slafíngw i hanmiís, nee hiinsla nee mura' sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós xoordu sleémeero gina iihhaáf baraá heé wák wa aleeró, giri qaás baraá yaamu sleémeero. Inósuú kilá' iimír aange qom'i gina qaás, nee harki/isoó hotangw'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
