              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú adoorí gana tleéhh as inooín inós kuwa leelehhiiti tam handá' ngu slaslay'aakáhe as kuwa slay. Ala tam adoorihe inós ku saaweeká dír umuúqo heerene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
