          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe Paulo iri quútl, mukdá' guri didií geexáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu bahh'alé iri haragwaá' amór Paulo, tari haratlintií'. Baraá tla/ángw mukwihe heeko a Dionisio. Inós a heé doó kwasleema oo Areopago. Heé hatlá' a /ameenirka wák, umuuwós ta bay Damari, nee mukko hatlá' sleeme i deer.",
          "type": "text",
